The <ansi fg="command">Skill Attunement</ansi> spell opens the caster's mind to accelerated
learning, heightening the neural pathways that govern skill growth.
While attuned, the caster absorbs lessons from every action and
advances their abilities at a markedly faster rate.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast skill-attunement</ansi>

